WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.916 --> 00:00:18.567
"Oops!" Jen cried.

2
00:00:18.587 --> 00:00:20.328
"Sorry about that!"

3
00:00:21.169 --> 00:00:24.972
She grabbed a rag and started to mop up the soapy water on the floor.

4
00:00:25.492 --> 00:00:26.673
Ben and Winnie helped her.

5
00:00:29.074 --> 00:00:31.356
When the floor was dry, Jen sighed.

6
00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:35.421
"I'm sorry about something else, guys.

7
00:00:35.861 --> 00:00:42.323
Unfortunately, it's my duty as a safety patrol officer to report certain safety violations.

8
00:00:43.643 --> 00:00:49.085
That ladder wasn't secure, so She swallowed.

9
00:00:49.545 --> 00:00:52.505
"I have to bring you two down to the principal's office."

10
00:00:52.525 --> 00:00:56.326
"What?" Cleo burst out laughing.

11
00:00:57.607 --> 00:01:00.468
"You're bringing Ben and Winnie down to Mr.

12
00:01:00.548 --> 00:01:01.608
Freaky's office?"

13
00:01:02.668 --> 00:01:03.709
"Seriously, Jen?"

14
00:01:04.069 --> 00:01:04.690
Ben said.

15
00:01:05.230 --> 00:01:07.171
Jen nodded, not looking at them.

16
00:01:07.792 --> 00:01:08.712
Ben groaned.

17
00:01:08.732 --> 00:01:11.534
"This is ridiculous."

18
00:01:12.515 --> 00:01:15.817
Winnie looked annoyed too, but she didn't say anything.

19
00:01:17.459 --> 00:01:19.560
She and Ben followed Jen through the hallway.

20
00:01:20.541 --> 00:01:21.602
Jen knocked on Mr.

21
00:01:21.642 --> 00:01:24.083
Freaky's door, but there was no answer.

22
00:01:25.064 --> 00:01:26.085
She knocked harder.

23
00:01:26.105 --> 00:01:28.807
"Who is it?"

24
00:01:29.247 --> 00:01:30.548
a sleepy voice called.

25
00:01:31.516 --> 00:01:33.697
"Safety patrol," Jen said.

26
00:01:34.577 --> 00:01:36.798
Mr. Freaky poked his head out the door.

27
00:01:37.479 --> 00:01:40.900
He was holding a sleep mask, and his hair was sticking up.

28
00:01:40.920 --> 00:01:43.761
"Can you come back later, Jen?

29
00:01:43.781 --> 00:01:47.803
I'm, um, very busy right now."

30
00:01:48.903 --> 00:01:50.204
"Sorry to bother you, Mr.

31
00:01:50.264 --> 00:01:51.525
Freaky," Jen said.

32
00:01:51.545 --> 00:01:57.147
"But I have to report two students for violating the safety protocols described in Section 72-N."

33
00:01:57.167 --> 00:02:00.201
"Huh?" Mr.

34
00:02:00.281 --> 00:02:01.742
Freaky cocked his head at her.

35
00:02:01.762 --> 00:02:04.225
"Section 72-N?"

36
00:02:05.026 --> 00:02:07.348
Jen recited some of the text from memory.

37
00:02:07.368 --> 00:02:12.013
"'Any students operating ladders in the hallway must operate them safely.

38
00:02:12.373 --> 00:02:19.120
Violators must be brought immediately to the principal's Mr.

39
00:02:19.200 --> 00:02:22.444
Freaky sighed and opened the door wider to let them in.

40
00:02:24.064 --> 00:02:29.847
"Jen, as I told Mog, monster safety patrol officers are not police officers.

41
00:02:30.568 --> 00:02:36.251
Your job is to just keep students safe, not bring them down here for every little violation.

42
00:02:36.631 --> 00:02:44.476
Besides," he added with another sigh, "I asked Ben and Winnie to clean the main entrance for tomorrow's

43
00:02:44.556 --> 00:02:48.038
inspection." Jen held up her handbook.

44
00:02:48.058 --> 00:02:50.600
"I've read this thing from front to back, Mr.

45
00:02:50.660 --> 00:02:55.803
Freaky. It says that the principal should get involved when it's a life-and-death situation."

46
00:02:55.823 --> 00:02:59.284
"It wasn't life-and-death," Winnie burst out.

47
00:02:59.304 --> 00:03:03.667
"The only time I was in danger was when you shook the ladder, Jen!"

48
00:03:04.567 --> 00:03:06.609
Mr. Freaky put his head in his hands.

49
00:03:07.449 --> 00:03:12.012
"I'm not sure the monster safety patrol is working out," he mumbled.

50
00:03:13.192 --> 00:03:16.214
He took the handbook from Jen and skimmed a few pages.

51
00:03:20.404 --> 00:03:21.585
This is outdated."

52
00:03:22.165 --> 00:03:23.365
He glanced at a clock.

53
00:03:25.946 --> 00:03:27.847
"Lunch period is almost over, students.

54
00:03:28.347 --> 00:03:29.648
You should go to class now."

55
00:03:29.668 --> 00:03:32.389
"But Jen bit her lip.

56
00:03:32.409 --> 00:03:35.370
"If we don't take safety seriously, Mr.

57
00:03:35.431 --> 00:03:39.232
Freaky, Dave's mom won't let him come to the sleepover."

58
00:03:39.872 --> 00:03:41.973
Tears began streaming down Jen's face.

59
00:03:46.075 --> 00:03:47.556
if Dave can't come?"

60
00:03:48.624 --> 00:03:51.547
"I'm sure everything will be fine, Jen," Winnie mumbled.

61
00:03:51.567 --> 00:03:55.490
"As long as you let us clean the school building," Ben added.

62
00:03:56.330 --> 00:03:57.191
Jen flushed.

63
00:03:57.211 --> 00:03:59.453
"There, there, Jen."

64
00:03:59.873 --> 00:04:03.536
Mr. Freaky reached into his pocket and pulled out a handkerchief for her.

65
00:04:03.556 --> 00:04:04.878
"Don't you worry.

66
00:04:05.138 --> 00:04:09.762
By the time of the sleepover, things are going to be running very smoothly around here.

67
00:04:10.742 --> 00:04:13.144
Everything is totally under control."

68
00:04:14.025 --> 00:04:16.908
Just then the office ogre burst into the office.

69
00:04:17.708 --> 00:04:18.689
"Mr. Freaky!"

70
00:04:19.049 --> 00:04:19.649
she cried.

71
00:04:19.669 --> 00:04:22.551
"Everything is totally out of control!

72
00:04:23.272 --> 00:04:25.693
A wild dog is running loose in the halls!"

73
00:04:25.713 --> 00:04:27.994
"What?" Mr.

74
00:04:28.074 --> 00:04:30.476
Freaky gasped and darted under his desk.

75
00:04:30.496 --> 00:04:33.357
"Did you say there's a wild dog out there?"

76
00:04:33.377 --> 00:04:37.700
"Yes! It woke up all the zombies in the cafeteria!"

77
00:04:38.020 --> 00:04:39.261
the office ogre said.

78
00:04:39.281 --> 00:04:42.443
"And now it's chasing other students near the gym."

79
00:04:43.443 --> 00:04:44.164
Ben gulped.

80
00:04:45.836 --> 00:04:48.277
He could hear a loud commotion out in the hallway.

81
00:04:48.857 --> 00:04:52.259
Students ran and screamed as the dog barked and growled.

82
00:04:52.279 --> 00:04:55.200
"This is terrible!"

83
00:04:55.560 --> 00:04:56.781
Mr. Freaky moaned.

84
00:04:56.801 --> 00:04:59.562
"What if Mayor Hubbletree hears about it?"

85
00:04:59.582 --> 00:05:03.583
"You'd better get out there, sir," the office ogre said.

86
00:05:03.603 --> 00:05:06.024
"It could be a dangerous situation."

87
00:05:06.585 --> 00:05:10.566
Mr. Freaky peeked out from under his desk, his noses wiggling.

88
00:05:10.586 --> 00:05:13.187
"I'm sure it's a dangerous situation!

89
00:05:13.447 --> 00:05:14.768
That's why I'm under here!"

90
00:05:16.156 --> 00:05:17.137
"I'll take care of it."

91
00:05:17.417 --> 00:05:20.700
Jen quickly brushed away her tears and ran out of the office.

92
00:05:21.701 --> 00:05:26.145
As Ben and Winnie took off after her, Ben noticed that the halls were now deserted.

93
00:05:26.165 --> 00:05:30.109
"Ar-ooo!" Lon ran by them.

94
00:05:30.129 --> 00:05:33.452
"A dangerous wild dog is on the loose!"

95
00:05:34.253 --> 00:05:35.734
"No howling in the halls!"

96
00:05:36.034 --> 00:05:37.115
Jen snapped at him.

97
00:05:37.135 --> 00:05:39.257
"Safety rule number 52!"

98
00:05:39.878 --> 00:05:42.080
Soon the office ogre came out of the office.

99
00:05:47.272 --> 00:05:49.233
Mr. Freaky crouched behind her.

100
00:05:49.253 --> 00:05:51.334
"Remain calm!"

101
00:05:51.854 --> 00:05:53.095
the office ogre shouted.

102
00:05:53.115 --> 00:05:55.056
"Um, yes!"

103
00:05:55.396 --> 00:05:56.417
Mr. Freaky said.

104
00:05:56.437 --> 00:05:59.659
"Everything is totally under control!"

105
00:06:00.199 --> 00:06:01.780
A fish monster hurried by.

106
00:06:01.800 --> 00:06:03.460
"No, it's not!"

107
00:06:03.761 --> 00:06:06.182
he cried, pointing toward where he'd come from.

108
00:06:06.742 --> 00:06:09.183
A small group of students was frozen in fear.

109
00:06:11.760 --> 00:06:14.563
A two-headed dog stood snarling at them.

110
00:06:14.583 --> 00:06:17.126
"That wild dog is going to eat us!"

111
00:06:17.506 --> 00:06:18.707
the fish monster said.

112
00:06:18.727 --> 00:06:20.209
"Please, Mr.

113
00:06:20.269 --> 00:06:22.091
Freaky, you have to protect us!"
